# Non-secret settings only. Never commit .env.
# API tokens: placeholders only. Real values live OUTSIDE the repo in
# ~/.ioassistant/secrets.env (or in your shell environment). Never commit them.
# Jira Cloud (sectigo.atlassian.net): basic auth with your Atlassian account email + an API token
# (https://id.atlassian.com/manage-profile/security/api-tokens). The same pair also covers Confluence Cloud (/wiki).
